    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronouns after a preposition",
     "texto": [
      "After a preposition a long form is used: **ze mną**, **z tobą**, **do niego**, **dla niej**, **o nich**.",
      "Before certain forms **n-** is added: **do niego**, **z nią**, **przy nich**. One does not say *do go* or *z ją*."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
